<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rate rises to 8.34 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rate rises to 8.34 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar rose to 8.34 percent on Tuesday from 6.72 percent on Monday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>The Central Bank said ten banks traded on the market in 27 reported transactions with a total value of 27.16 million dinars</p>
<p>$1 = 0.7080 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
</text>
